1 (SYSV), for GNU/Linux 2.4.20, stripped
/lib64/libdb-4.3.so <http://libdb-4.3.so>: ELF 64-bit LSB shared object, AMD x86-64, version
1 (SYSV), for GNU/Linux 2.4.20, stripped

 -Harlan

